          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Our faculty from the Section of Cardiology, Department of Medicine taught various skills within these stations. Learners were in small groups allowing hands-on practice, brushing up on their clinical skills. We really appreciate one of the original CIME Champions, Dr Aamir Hameed Khan, Associate Professor and Service Line Chief, Section of Cardiology, Department of Medicine, for leading this workshop. There is further demand for updates on  the diagnosis and treatment of hypertension and this workshop will be repeated in January 2022.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
