    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A simulation-based workshop on hypertension was held at CIME. 18 general practitioners from across Pakistan participated in this workshop. There were four stations: Abnormal Heart Sound; Fundoscopy examination; Counselling and referral of high risk hypertension patient; and a Basic Life Support refresher (not everyone has the luxury of the QCPR equipment at CIME meaning practitioners cannot attest to being competent by global standards).",
